g a higher-priority attacker's decision, but the established, required-guarantee violation is the SRC_007 covering-principle breach, not a generic reinstatement-property violation. The defender concedes the SRC_007 violation as stated by the target; the broader reinstatement framing is not independently established beyond what the mechanism already entails."}